ob filename text source be input ya
exists su name hear backend default ob text "whisperx" be default ya

ob filename of ob of source to name filename source filename be filename do
ob text of ob of source filename to name text source path be text do
ob name run root to name text workspace root be text do
ob name run id to name text run id be text do

ob text "basename \"" to name text stem cmd be text do
ob name source path to name stem cmd be plus do
ob text "\" | sed 's/\\.[^.]*$//' | sed 's/[^[:alnum:]_-]/_/g' | tr -s '_' | sed 's/^_//;s/_$//' | tr -d '\\n'" to name stem cmd be plus do
su name stem safe stage ob name text stem cmd be command do

ob name workspace root to name text run artifacts dir path be plus do
ob text "/artifacts/" to name run artifacts dir path be plus do
ob name run id to name run artifacts dir path be plus do

ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text artifacts mkdir cmd be text do
ob name run artifacts dir path to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
ob text "/hear\"" to name artifacts mkdir cmd be plus do
su name artifacts mkdir stage ob name text artifacts mkdir cmd be command do

ob name run artifacts dir path to name text local srt path be plus do
ob text "/hear/" to name local srt path be plus do
ob name stem safe stage to name local srt path be plus do
ob text "-speaker.srt" to name local srt path be plus do
su name local srt filename stage ob name text local srt path to name filename local srt filename be filename do

ob name workspace root to name text produce dir path be plus do
ob text "/know/produce" to name produce dir path be plus do

ob text "mkdir -p \"" to name text produce mkdir cmd be text do
ob name produce dir path to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name produce mkdir cmd be plus do
su name produce mkdir stage ob name text produce mkdir cmd be command do

ob name produce dir path to name text produce srt path be plus do
ob text "/" to name produce srt path be plus do
ob name stem safe stage to name produce srt path be plus do
ob text ".srt" to name produce srt path be plus do

su name hear stage from filename of ob of source as wo speaker become wo srt to filename of ob of local srt filename stage be hear do
ob text "cp \"" to name text copy cmd be text do
ob name local srt path to name copy cmd be plus do
ob text "\" \"" to name copy cmd be plus do
ob name produce srt path to name copy cmd be plus do
ob text "\"" to name copy cmd be plus do
su name copy stage ob name text copy cmd be command do
be discharge as wo hear do

su name output stage ob name produce srt path be write do
